280 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every hero starts with a class — None end the same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your hero from race, class, and difficulty choices, then grow through a mix of class identity, player choice, emergent talent offers, spells, loot, and rare rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“<i>Some builds become legends. Others become lessons.</i>”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/2042e2b123943cb24cae10311d506143.avif?t=1780195919\" width=600 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/fa154d8b168699a95b3f5f7c5de9138c.avif?t=1780195919\" width=600 height=333 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/555fcdcf222c6191f9c8c333f8fb4883.avif?t=1780195919\" width=1280 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore, quest and challenge yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you want to play. Follow the main campaign, chase optional quests, explore the world map, discover points of interest, or push into special modes where the stakes rise the deeper you crawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“<i>One more floor is always a reasonable idea. Until it isn’t.</i>”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/a3e33623081183c3be2f866f4e2ef0bb.poster.avif?t=1780195919\" width=798 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai