lete powerful item sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“<i>A strict no-refunds policy applies. Mostly to your life.</i>”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/1d8c5518f57b50c97c6edfd65721e69d.poster.avif?t=1780195919\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/1d8c5518f57b50c97c6edfd65721e69d.webm?t=1780195919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/1d8c5518f57b50c97c6edfd65721e69d.mp4?t=1780195919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/555fcdcf222c6191f9c8c333f8fb4883.avif?t=1780195919\" width=1280 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Death Is Not the End</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new perks, discover illustrated story paths, reach different endings, and climb the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > “Your hero may fall, but at least they were useful currency.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/8293a00f7ba65358953f7536e33d7db8.avif?t=1780195919\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/7e51b29c28551ab631fb9f25b9a719e5.avif?t=1780195919\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstati